{"id":"wb-6-314","name":"报国寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大报国慈仁寺","text":"大报国慈仁寺是位于北京市西城区广安门内街道报国寺前街1号的寺庙。该寺先后有慈仁寺、大报国慈仁寺等名，当地居民以报国寺相称。报国寺曾有七进院落，七层殿堂，后有毗卢阁，为当时北京南城最大庙宇。1984年5月24日，报国寺及顾亭林祠被列入第三批北京市文物保护单位。2006年，报国寺被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%8A%A5%E5%9B%BD%E6%85%88%E4%BB%81%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":91540577,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91540577","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ca0d917c34240da57ca5008a.jpg","title":"北京报国寺大殿_正面.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%8A%A5%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF_%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%8A%A5%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF_%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"維基小霸王","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Photographs taken in Beijing.","width":320,"height":240}}